 BonusActionButtonDown(buttonID);
Presses the specified "bonus" (pet or minion) action button.

== Parameters ==

=== Arguments ===

:; buttonID
:: Number - The button ID of the bonus button to push

=== Returns ===

:; nil

=== Example ===
 BonusActionButtonDown(1);



